THE SOURCE SURFACE, run by the root that carries the lowering. The sessions above mutate artifacts; this one mutates source and reaches the tokenizer, the parser and the lowering - the surface JSC-47 recorded as existing and unfuzzed. The matcher is still reached by no session at all.

